# Vendored front-end asset manifest
#
# TableX vendors its front-end libraries (no build step; each is embedded into
# the single binary via go:embed). This file records the provenance and an
# integrity baseline for every vendored bundle so a reviewer can audit what ships
# and a maintainer can re-verify on every bump.
#
# Each SHA-256 below is of the exact vendored copy in this repository (compute
# with `sha256sum <file>`). On any version bump you MUST:
#   1. download the file from the upstream release / CDN URL for the new version,
#   2. confirm its SHA-256 matches the CDN's published Subresource-Integrity hash
#      (or the release artifact), and
#   3. update the version, URL, and SHA-256 rows here in the same commit.
#
# Licenses are all permissive and compatible with TableX's MIT distribution
# (MPL-2.0 applies file-level to the go-sql-driver/mysql Go dependency only —
# see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES).
# Versions were cross-checked against the npm registry (htmx.org@2.0.10 → 0BSD,
# @alpinejs/csp@3.15.12 → MIT) and the projects' GitHub releases (Bootstrap
# v5.3.8, CodeMirror v5.65.21 → MIT).

